--- !u!114 &1957315984
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1957315978}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f337b7db6aeb86c4e9a77b0bf7306e20, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  messages:
  - actorID: 0
    message: Ah, my lord, you have returned.
  - actorID: 0
    message: I've been waiting for your return from paying respects to your father's
      grave.
  - actorID: 1
    message: (Nods) It was a moment of reflection.
  - actorID: 1
    message: But now, I feel a stirring within me.
  - actorID: 1
    message: I've decided to embark on a journey to find a name for myself.
  - actorID: 0
    message: A noble quest, my lord.
  - actorID: 0
    message: However, I must warn you.
  - actorID: 0
    message: The outside world, especially the human realm, has changed since your
      father's time. They wield weapons and technologies beyond our comprehension.
  - actorID: 0
    message: It was their modern techniques that led to our defeat.
  - actorID: 1
    message: ????
  - actorID: 1
    message: (Frowns) Is that so?
  - actorID: 1
    message: Then I shall make them pay for what they've done to my father and our
      kind!
  - actorID: 0
    message: My lord, vengeance blinds us.  We must tread carefully.
  - actorID: 0
    message: 'But before we discuss further, there''s an important matter I must
      share with you. '
  - actorID: 0
    message: However, you have a trial to pass first.
  - actorID: 1
    message: What trial?
  - actorID: 0
    message: Meet me in the dungeon. There, I will reveal everything.
  - actorID: 0
    message: But be warned, the path won't be easy. You must survive and make your
      way to me.
  - actorID: 1
    message: Very well. I shall meet you in the dungeon.
  actors:
  - actorName: The Vizier
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
  - actorName: Nameless One
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
